  "pitfallsTitle": "Before you start, the common mistakes",
  "pitfallOpenPacksEarly": "Opening the packs too early: they stay closed and flat for 48 h in the room, heating on as usual.",
  "pitfallWetScreed": "Laying on a screed that's still damp: vapour barrier film required, and a recent screed must be dry (about 3 weeks per cm).",
  "pitfallUnevenFloor": "Not checking flatness: more than 5 mm under a 2 m straightedge, level it first.",
  "pitfallUndercutTooHigh": "Cutting the architrave too high: rest the saw on a board laid on its underlay.",
  "pitfallUnderlayOverlap": "Overlapping the underlay: the strips go edge to edge, taped.",
  "pitfallVaporBarrierGaps": "Vapour barrier without overlap: 20 cm between strips and 5 cm turned up the walls.",
  "pitfallGlueSkinned": "Letting the adhesive skin over: only spread enough for a few boards, according to its open time.",
  "pitfallGlueUnderdosed": "Wrong amount of adhesive: the specified notched trowel, and the whole underside must be covered.",
  "pitfallJoistsNotLevel": "Battens not level: pack each one and check with the level in both directions.",
  "pitfallCrookedFirstWall": "Trusting the first wall: it's never straight, snap a chalk line.",
  "pitfallPlankDirection": "Wrong board direction: normally in the direction of the light, or along a hallway.",
  "pitfallNoExpansionGap": "Forgetting the expansion gap: 8 to 10 mm everywhere, walls, door frames, pipes.",
  "pitfallTongueTowardsWall": "Tongue towards the wall: cut it off on the first row, groove towards you.",
  "pitfallSpacersMoved": "Spacers that move: wedge them every 50 cm and at each end of a row.",
  "pitfallSplitTongue": "Splitting the tongue: pins at 45°, nail punch to finish.",
  "pitfallNarrowLastRow": "Last row too narrow: under 5 cm, rip the first one too to balance.",
  "pitfallSpacersLeft": "Forgetting a spacer: it locks the floor as it moves.",
  "pitfallThresholdScrewed": "Screwing a threshold strip into a floating floor: it's fixed to the subfloor, never to the boards.",
  "pitfallMiterWrongWay": "Mitre cut the wrong way: inside corner, the skirting is longer at the bottom; outside, at the top.",
  "pitfallShortMeasure": "Measuring at the wrong end: take the measurement at floor level, at the long point.",
  "pitfallSkipDryFit": "Gluing without a dry fit: offer up both skirtings of a corner before fixing.",
  "pitfallBaseboardOnFloor": "Fixing the skirting to the floating floor: it's glued or nailed to the wall only.",
  "pitfallSiliconeToPaint": "Silicone on what you'll paint: acrylic sealant for joints to be painted.",
