  "woodWindowTooThin": "Timber too thin: less than {lip} mm is left in front of the rebate. Take thicker timber.",
  "woodWindowWhyOuter": "Frame: the opening minus {gap} mm of fitting play on each side, that is {width} × {height} cm.",
  "woodWindowWhyTenon": "Tenon: a third of the timber thickness ({depth} mm), two thirds of its width ({width} mm). The stiles run top to bottom, the rails fit into them.",
  "woodWindowWhyGlass": "Glazing: the clear opening between the timbers, plus {depth} mm of rebate cover on each side, minus {gap} mm of play for the packers.",
