  "woodWindowSteps": "Order: cut and plane, mark and cut the mortises, saw the tenons, rout the rebate, glue and clamp square (equal diagonals), stain, set the glazing on two setting blocks a quarter in from the corners, then the glazing beads. Measure the glazing you receive before nailing.",
