  "speciesDouglasTip": "Softwood that lasts outdoors untreated if you take the heartwood, without the pale sapwood. A good choice for a window or a pergola.",
  "speciesLarchTip": "Very durable outdoors, weathers nicely to grey in the sun. A bit more lively to work, plan stainless screws.",
