  "sealingSteps": "Order: sill fitted and slope checked, foam stuck on three sides of the frame, frame packed level and screwed, vapour barrier tape on the room side, outdoor sealant on a clean dry backer rod, then glazing on packers and glazing beads. No sealant on the outside bottom of the glazing in a frame that needs to drain: leave its drainage holes clear.",
