  "finishFloorVarnishLook": "Hard varnish made to be walked on: wood floor, stairs, worktop.",
  "finishOilLook": "Soaks into the fibres and feeds them, with no film to flake. Natural look; a scratch can be touched up on the spot.",
  "finishWaxLook": "Soft, mellow feel, for warm and dry places only: it doesn't like water and stains.",
