  "eavesTip": "Measure the slope angle at each end: a roof is never quite straight. Cut a test upright from an offcut, offer it up, then transfer the angle to the others.",
  "eavesHint": "A front of about one metre is used without bending down; higher, the cupboard gains volume but eats into the room. Leave a hatch if ducts or extraction run behind.",
