  "gestureChisel1": "Mark the mortise with a marking gauge, a little narrower than the piece's thickness.",
  "gestureChisel2": "Chisel upright, bevel facing the middle, one blow of the mallet every 5 mm along the line.",
  "gestureChisel3": "Clear the chips, go again deeper, then finish both ends nice and plumb.",
  "gestureChiselMistake": "Starting on the line: the edges get crushed. Stay 1 mm inside, then pare to the line at the end.",
  "gestureChiselMortise": "marked mortise",
  "gestureChiselBevel": "bevel towards the middle",
