  "gesturePlugUse": "Fix a shelf, a cabinet or a bracket firmly into a hollow or solid wall.",
  "gesturePlug1": "Run the detector over the wall: no cable or pipe under the spot to drill.",
  "gesturePlug2": "Drill at the diameter written on the plug, a little deeper than its length, and blow the dust out of the hole.",
  "gesturePlug3": "Push the plug in flush with the wall, offer up the piece, then screw until it grips without spinning.",
